  "difficulty": "Hard",
  "description": "The set [1, 2, 3, ..., n] contains a total of n! unique permutations.\nBy listing and labeling all of the permutations in order, we get the following sequence for n = 3:\nGiven n and k, return the kth permutation sequence.",
